\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{dt}(\\frac{dy}{dx})}{(\\frac{dx}{dt})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{dt}(6{t}^{3})}{3{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{18{t}^{2}}{3{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263113 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263114 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263115 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263116 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263117 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1041 "selection" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1104 #edb/ref 17592186263114 13194139533882 true] [17592186263112 1110 #uuid "e8eb8cd0-fcac-5a6a-bc6e-25056dfbd68d" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263113 1034 "2" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263113 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533882 true] [17592186263113 1111 #uuid "6037ca87-a84a-5b3b-b31c-f76225901a2b" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263114 1034 "6" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263114 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533882 true] [17592186263114 1111 #uuid "e6c83168-f9f8-5298-b7c5-8d26af3cc218" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263115 1034 "{t}^{2}" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263115 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533882 true] [17592186263115 1111 #uuid "5953b84f-786c-514c-a61e-2b10ad8d45f8" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263116 1034 "6t" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263116 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533882 true] [17592186263116 1111 #uuid "91f85b9f-b136-5788-8649-639417f2d2a1" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263117 1034 "3t" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263117 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533882 true] [17592186263117 1111 #uuid "73c4bbf4-e461-5111-9342-1de9ce64eaed" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263118 1017 #edb/ref 17592186263119 13194139533882 true] [17592186263118 1089 "q-122884" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263118 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533882 true] [17592186263118 1100 "A curve is defined by the parametric equations $x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t)-4,\\,y=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)+7.$ Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}.$" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263118 1113 #uuid "dc3565c8-a104-503d-8d29-7c96e1c43097" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263118 1145 "To find the first derivative, we will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t),\\,{y}^{′}(t)=-10\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t).\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac{10\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t)}{5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)}=-2\\operatorname{tan}⁡(5t).\n$$\n\nTo compute the second derivative, we can use the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{dt}(\\frac{dy}{dx})}{(\\frac{dx}{dt})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{dt}(-2\\operatorname{tan}⁡(5t))}{5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{10{sec}^{2}⁡(5t)}{5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)} \\\\  & =-2{sec}^{3}⁡(5t).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263120 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263121 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263122 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263123 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263124 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1041 "selection" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1104 #edb/ref 17592186263122 13194139533882 true] [17592186263119 1110 #uuid "a32006a1-f8d0-59e2-8316-3dbbd1ee1166" 13194139533882 true] [17592186263120 1034 "{sec}^{3}⁡(5